{"answer": "1. $G(z)=\\dfrac{(2z-1)(1-e^{-1})}{z^2-(1+e^{-1})z+e^{-1}}$，\n$\\dfrac{C(z)}{R(z)}=\\dfrac{(2z-1)(1-e^{-1})}{z^2+(1-3e^{-1})z+(2e^{-1}-1)}\\approx\\dfrac{0.632(2z-1)}{z^2-0.104z-0.264}$。\n\n2. $D(1)=1-e^{-1}>0$，$D(-1)=5e^{-1}-1>0$，$|2e^{-1}-1|<1$，闭环**稳定**（根 $0.568,\\ -0.465$）。\n\n3. $e_{ss}(\\infty)=0$。", "explanation": "$\\mathcal Z\\!\\left[1+\\dfrac1s\\right]=\\dfrac{2z-1}{z-1}$，$\\mathcal Z\\!\\left[\\dfrac{1-e^{-Ts}}{s}\\cdot\\dfrac1{s+1}\\right]=\\dfrac{1-e^{-T}}{z-e^{-T}}$，两者相乘。\n\n$e_{ss}=\\lim_{z\\to1}(z-1)\\left[1-\\Phi(z)\\right]\\dfrac{z}{z-1}=1-\\dfrac{1-e^{-1}}{1-e^{-1}}=0$。", "originalImages": [{"src": "img/a2024-6-1.png", "w": 260}, {"src": "img/a2024-6-2.png", "w": 696}, {"src": "img/a2024-6-3.png", "w": 439}], "answerPdfPages": "181–191", "notes": "已核对：正确。$G(z)$、闭环、朱利稳定与单位阶跃 $e_{ss}=0$ 均对。", "errataLevel": "ok"}